<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability1> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Aatrox swings his greatsword, dealing damage." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability2> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Aatrox smashes the ground, dealing damage and pulling enemies." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability3> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Aatrox dashes, dealing damage and healing himself." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability4> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Aatrox transforms, gaining attack damage and resurrecting on taking lethal damage." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability5> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ahri sends out and pulls back her orb, dealing damage each way." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability6> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ahri releases three fox-fires, damaging nearby enemies." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability7> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ahri blows a kiss that charms and damages an enemy." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability8> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ahri dashes forward and fires essence bolts, damaging nearby enemies." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability9> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Akali throws kunai, dealing damage in a cone." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability10> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Akali drops a smoke bomb, becoming invisible and gaining movement speed." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability11> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Akali flips backward and throws a shuriken forward." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability12> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Akali dashes twice, dealing damage." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability13> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ashe fires arrows in a cone, dealing damage." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability14> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ashe sends a hawk spirit on a scouting mission." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability15> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ashe gains attack speed and her basic attacks fire a flurry of arrows." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability16> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ashe fires a giant arrow that stuns and damages the first enemy hit." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability17> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Garen gains a burst of speed and strikes an enemy." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability18> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Garen reduces incoming damage for a few seconds." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability19> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Garen rapidly spins around, dealing damage to nearby enemies." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability20> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Garen calls down the might of Demacia on his opponent, dealing a finishing blow." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability21> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Caitlyn revs up her rifle for a penetrating shot." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability22> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Caitlyn sets traps that immobilize and reveal enemies." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability23> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Caitlyn fires a net, knocking herself backward and slowing an enemy." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability24> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Caitlyn takes time to line up the perfect shot, dealing massive damage to a single target." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability25> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Darius swings his axe in a wide circle, dealing damage." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability26> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Darius's next attack deals bonus damage and slows the target." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability27> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Darius pulls in enemies with his axe's hook." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability28> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Darius leaps to an enemy and executes them with a powerful chop." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability29> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Jinx swaps her minigun and rocket launcher." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability30> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Jinx fires a shock blast that slows and damages the first enemy hit." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability31> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Jinx tosses out three grenades that explode and root enemies." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability32> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Jinx fires a global rocket that gains damage as it travels, exploding on impact." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability33> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Yasuo thrusts his sword forward, dealing damage." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability34> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Yasuo creates a moving wall that blocks projectiles." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability35> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Yasuo dashes through a target, dealing damage." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability36> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Yasuo blinks to an airborne enemy champion, dealing damage and keeping them in the air." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability37> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ezreal fires a bolt of energy, dealing damage." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability38> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ezreal fires an orb that sticks to the first champion or objective hit." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability39> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ezreal teleports to a target location and fires a homing bolt." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#ability40> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ezreal winds up for a powerful shot that deals massive damage to all targets hit." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#FlameChompers> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Jinx tosses out 3 Chompers centered at the target location, landing after 0.4 seconds, arming after 0.5 seconds, and exploding after 5 seconds to deal magic damage to nearby enemies." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#Judgment> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Garen rapidly spins his sword around himself 7 (+ 1 per 25% bonus attack speed) times over 3 seconds, becoming Ghost ghosted and unable to basic attack and dealing physical damage to nearby enemies periodically. Judgment can be recast after 1 second for its duration, and does so automatically after it ends." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#EssenceTheft> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ahri generates a stack of Essence Fragment whenever she kills a Minion icon minion or Monster icon monster. At 9 stacks, she consumes them to Heal power icon heal herself for 35 − 95 (based on level) (+ 20% AP)." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#OrbofDeception> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ahri sends her orb in the target direction that deals magic damage to enemies hit. At maximum range, the orb homes back to her to deal the same in Hybrid penetration icon true damage to enemies hit." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#Perseverance> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Garen Health regeneration icon regenerates 1.5% − 10.1% (based on level) of his Health icon maximum health every 5 seconds." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#Courage> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "For each stack, Garen gains Armor icon 0.2 bonus armor and Magic resistance icon 0.2 bonus magic resistance, up to a maximum of 30 bonus resistances each. After reaching maximum stacks, Garen gains 10% bonus armor and 10% bonus magic resistance." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#DecisiveStrike> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Garen Remove Scurvy cleanses himself of all Slow icon slows and gains Movement speed icon 35% bonus movement speed for a duration.\nAdditionally, Garen empowers his next basic attack within 4.5 seconds to have an Relentless Force 2 uncancellable windup, Bear Stance lunge at the target, deal bonus physical damage, and Silence icon silence them for 1.5 seconds." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#Switcheroo> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Jinx switches between Pow-Pow Pow-Pow, her minigun, and Fishbones Fishbones, her rocket launcher." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#SpiritRush> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ahri Dash dashes to the target location and then fires essence bolts to up to 3 nearby Sight icon visible enemies, each dealing magic damage.\n\nSpirit Rush can be recast twice more within 15 seconds of the activation at no additional cost, with a 1-second static cooldown between casts. Consuming a champion's essence with Essence Theft Essence Theft while Spirit Rush is active extends the recast duration by and up to 10 seconds, and grants an additional recast, storing up to 3 recasts at a time." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#FoxFire> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ahri gains Movement speed icon 40% bonus movement speed that decays over 2 seconds and conjures three flames which orbit her clockwise for up to 2.5 seconds. After 0.25 seconds of the cast, each flame targets a Sight icon visible enemy based on priority, or after 0.4 seconds, simply targets the closest visible enemy in range. Each flame deals magic damage, with subsequent flames against a target dealing 30% damage." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#Charm> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Ahri blows forth a kiss in the target direction that deals magic damage to the first enemy hit, Knockdown icon knocking them down and Charm icon charming and Slow icon slowing them by 65% for a duration." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#DemacianJustice> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Garen calls upon the might of Demacia onto the target enemy Champion icon champion, dealing them Hybrid penetration icon true damage as well as True Sight icon revealing them for 1 second at the start of the cast time." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#SuperMegaDeathRocket> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Jinx fires a massive rocket in the target direction, briefly granting Sight of its surroundings and exploding upon colliding with an enemy champion. The explosion deals physical damage to nearby enemies and grants Sight of the area for 2 seconds." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#Zap> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Jinx fires a shock blast in the target direction that deals physical damage to the first enemy it hits and Reveal reveals and Slow slows them for 2 seconds." .
<http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#GetExcited> <http://www.semanticweb.org/MobaOntology#abilityDescription> "Whenever Jinx scores a Damage rating takedown against an enemy Champion, epic Monster, Turret, or inhibitor within 3 seconds of damaging them, she gains Movement speed icon 175% bonus movement speed decaying over 6 seconds." .
